# 换行与二进制策略 / Line-ending & binary policy
#
# 本仓库刻意不做自动换行转换（与 core.autocrlf=false 一致）：
# 源码按提交时的原样保存，避免整文件「全行改写」的噪声 diff。
* -text

# Windows 批处理必须是 CRLF，否则 cmd.exe 解析异常
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制资源
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.bmp binary
*.tga binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pyd binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.mp4 binary
*.psd binary
*.ttf binary
*.qm binary

# GitHub 语言统计：把 .set 视为配置文件而非源码
*.set linguist-language=Scheme
*.spec linguist-language=Python

# 语言包在 GitHub 上折叠显示
src/translations/*.json linguist-generated=false
